65096e0           "description": "Refreshed look for the welcome screen, startup notices and What's new, without the startup tip"
650978c           "description": "The `/fullscreen` scroll-to-bottom pill has a dark fill, lights up on hover, and its dot turns green on new messages"
650984e           "description": "[V3] An answer cut off at the model's output limit now says so and suggests asking Kiro to continue"
6509a27           "description": "ACP clients can now sign in from a terminal when `kiro-cli acp` starts logged out"
6509ac4           "description": "`KIRO_RUNTIME_DIR` sets where Kiro extracts its bundled runtime instead of the home directory"
6509b6f           "description": "Fullscreen keeps the prompt on the bottom rows, even with a short transcript or after Ctrl+L"
6509c19           "description": "The Kiro logo ghost keeps its full color at rest instead of fading after the load animation"
6509cc2           "description": "On V3, V2-format agents are now upgraded automatically at launch; set `chat.enableAutoAgentUpgrade` to `false` to turn this off"
6509d8f           "description": "[V3] Approval prompts in the main chat show only a multi-line command's first line until `ctrl+o`"
6509e3e           "description": "[V3] The approval rule page highlights the scope choices, with the `s` hint beside them"
6509ee3           "description": "Mermaid diagrams preserve node shapes, type colors, and logical group markers"
6509f7e           "description": "`kiro-cli update` now suggests `brew upgrade --cask kiro-cli`, without `--greedy-auto-updates`"
650a028           "description": "`--no-interactive` runs that stop on an agent now say `stopping (exit 4)` instead of claiming a fallback"
650a0dc           "description": "[V3] `--no-interactive` runs stopped by a V2-format agent name `kiro-cli agent upgrade <dir>`"
650a185           "description": "Clicks in fullscreen, including the scroll-to-bottom pill, no longer land one row above the target when a line above it wraps"
650a24e           "description": "[V3] The entire-tool row on the approval rule page names the tool, such as Shell, instead of one call"
650a2ff           "description": "Mouse-wheel scrolling in `/fullscreen` works in AWS CloudShell and other terminals running older tmux versions"
650a3b9           "description": "The Kiro logo ghost stays on the home screen while a command menu such as `/agent` or a panel such as `/memories` is open, when there is room for it"
